usage: textproof [-h] {check,serve,verify-s0,version} ...

TextProof (字证): deterministic AI-image text verification, local CPU-only OCR.

positional arguments:
  {check,serve,verify-s0,version}
    check               Check one image against expected text; print or write
                        a textproof.report/v1 JSON report.
    serve               Serve the local API (loopback only, 127.0.0.1).
    verify-s0           Run the S0 gate (scripts/verify_s0.py) and pass
                        through its exit code.
    version             Print frozen versions as JSON.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
